From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mio <mio@mio19.uk>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 23:00:40 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] raumata: add USB companion serial mux

Parse both Meshtastic 0x94C3 framing and MeshCore '<' framing on the USB serial port. In dual builds SerialConsole becomes write-only while the mux owns reads; MeshCore mode suppresses Meshtastic debug output so companion apps see a clean frame stream.

